{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-magic-shell-coupling-kappa","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:magic-shell-coupling-kappa","kind":"definition","title":"The expression $\\kappa_{\\mathrm{closed}} = -E_0 \\log(1/h) / [3]_q!$","tags":["q-bracket","q-factorial","markov-weight","hecke-energy-scale","withdrawn-identification"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.BraidKnot.MagicShellCouplingKappa","text":"magic-shell-coupling-kappa.md","leanSource":"magic-shell-coupling-kappa.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:magic-shell-coupling-kappa\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code> be a substrate parameter and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> a mass scale. The <strong>expression <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\kappa_{\\mathrm{closed}}</code></strong> is</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  \\kappa_{\\mathrm{closed}}(q, m_e)\n  \\;=\\; -\\,\\frac{E_0 \\cdot \\log(1/h)}{[2]_q \\cdot [3]_q},\n  \\qquad\n  E_0 = \\frac{m_e}{q(q-1)}, \\quad h = q - q^{-1},</code></pre>\n<p><em>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">[n]_q = (q^n - q^{-n}) / (q - q^{-1})</code> is the balanced q-bracket.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/magic-shell-coupling-kappa.md","heading":"Definition","number":"9.11.7","page":"b/def-magic-shell-coupling-kappa","qa":{"counts":{"pass":86,"fail":1,"warn":3,"na":15,"unknown":0,"stale":91},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BraidsAndKnots.MagicShellCouplingKappa","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/knots-particles-confinement/magic-shell-coupling-kappa.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
